      "id": "1",
      "title": "Situation overview",
      "subsections": [
        {
          "id": "1a",
          "title": "Overview",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "text": "An industrial fire at Kellet Point triggered widespread emergency responses, infrastructure disruptions, and evacuations across Kellet Point industrial estate, Brayle, and <PERSON>.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [],
              "id": "1a.1"
            },
            {
              "text": "Extensive evacuations and displacements affected Brayle and <PERSON>, while environmental testing subsequently confirmed no contamination in Merrin Canal and no fatalities were reported.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [],
              "id": "1a.2"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2",
      "title": "Timeline",
      "subsections": [
        {
          "id": "2a",
          "title": "Chronological timeline",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "text": "On the morning of 2 December 2025, Fallon Coatings deployed to Kellet Point, warnings were issued for Brayle and Sunder Flats, and Kellet Road was closed between Kellet Point industrial estate and <PERSON>.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                5,
                9,
                10,
                11,
                19
              ],
              "id": "2a.1"
            },
            {
              "text": "During the afternoon and evening of 2 December 2025, mandatory evacuations were enacted for <PERSON> and <PERSON>, displacing approximately 2,300 residents from Brayle and 300 from Osmery.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                89,
                94,
                124,
                135
              ],
              "id": "2a.2"
            },
            {
              "text": "On 3 December 2025, the Provincial Environmental Protection Agency deployed, authorities clarified that the Fallon Coatings warehouse was not involved in the fire, injuries were confirmed in <PERSON>, and warnings and service disruptions impacted <PERSON>.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                186,
                195,
                215,
                228,
                234
              ],
              "id": "2a.3"
            },
            {
              "text": "On 4 December 2025, environmental monitoring confirmed no contamination in Merrin Canal, physical damage was confirmed in Brayle, and officials confirmed that Sunder Flats was never subject to evacuation.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                268,
                292,
                299
              ],
              "id": "2a.4"
            },
            {
              "text": "On 5 December 2025, authorities confirmed zero fatalities, services and Kellet Road were restored, relief and community assistance were organized in Brayle, PEPA held coordination meetings, and Fallon Coatings revised its operational policy.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                331,
                333,
                336,
                341,
                356,
                360,
                381
              ],
              "id": "2a.5"
            }
          ]
        }
